---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import glyph from '../brand/glyph.svg?raw';
const goals = [
  'Run it yourself, in your own Cloudflare account.',
  'Nothing else to host or look after.',
  'Fill in the week, submit it, get it approved.',
  'Your data exports to common formats, any time.',
  'Committed to being open source.',
];
---
<Layout title="tidwick: weekly timesheets you run yourself" description="Weekly timesheets you run yourself, in your own Cloudflare account.">
  <div class="top">
  <section class="hero">
    <Fragment set:html={glyph} />
    <p class="kicker">weekly timesheets you run yourself</p>
    <h1>tidwick</h1>
    <p class="deck">Weekly timesheets you run yourself.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="cta primary" href="https://demo.tidwick.dev">Try the demo</a>
      <a class="cta" href="https://github.com/tidwick/tidwick">Run your own</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="goals">
    <h2 id="goals">Design goals</h2>
    <ol class="goals">
      {goals.map((g, i) => <li><span class="num">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span>{g}</span></li>)}
    </ol>
  </section>
  </div>
  <div class="tiles">
    <section class="tile">
      <h2>Try the demo</h2>
      <p>A running copy you can look around in.</p>
      <p><a href="https://demo.tidwick.dev">Open demo.tidwick.dev</a></p>
    </section>
    <section class="tile">
      <h2>Run your own</h2>
      <p>The <a href="https://github.com/tidwick/tidwick/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#9-deploy">docs walk through</a> deploying tidwick to your own Cloudflare account. It needs a Cloudflare account on the Workers Paid plan.</p>
      <p class="deploy">
        <a class="deploy-btn" href="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/tidwick/tidwick"><img src="/deploy-to-cloudflare.svg" alt="Deploy to Cloudflare" width="184" height="39" /></a>
      </p>
      <p>After deploying, open the new Worker's address. The setup page generates the keys in your browser, then a one-time setup token claims the first admin.</p>
      <p><strong>Why only Cloudflare?</strong> <a href="https://github.com/tidwick/tidwick/blob/main/docs/adr/0001-cloudflare-astro-platform.md">ADR 0001</a> explains the choice.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
